sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    actor Steward
    participant Dash as Admin dashboard<br/>admin/dashboard
    participant SitePage as Site page<br/>detail/[namesite]
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    Note over Admin,DB: Covers US 7.0.3 and US 7.0.4. Both read web app SIR data through server actions.<br/>US 7.0.4 is in the MoSCoW group Would Like But Won't Get. It stays here for reference.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Note over Admin,DB: US 7.0.3 See all inspections in one view
    Admin->>Dash: Open all-SIR summary. Set a date range (AT 2) (proposed)
    Dash->>Server: getSirSummary(fromDate, toDate) (proposed)
    Server->>Server: Check caller is Admin<br/>from a trusted role source, store not decided (proposed)
    alt Caller is not Admin (AT 3)
        Server-->>Dash: Refuse. Return no data
        Dash-->>Admin: Show "not allowed"
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: Count active SIRs in the range: per site, per steward,<br/>per Q42 answer, and Q31 score spread (proposed)
        DB-->>Server: Totals
        Server-->>Dash: Summary
        Dash-->>Admin: Show tables and charts (AT 1)
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: US 7.0.4 Compare one question across years
    Steward->>SitePage: Open Compare by question view (exists)
    SitePage->>Server: getFormResponsesBySite(siteName)<br/>(exists, change proposed)
    Server->>Server: Check session and approved account (proposed)
    Server->>DB: Read active SIRs with answers and the "question key"<br/>of each question (exists today through getReportQuestionKeyMap)
    DB-->>Server: SIRs and answers
    Server-->>SitePage: SIRs and answers, with the question key<br/>of each answer (proposed)
    Steward->>SitePage: Choose one question, for example Q63 (proposed)
    SitePage->>SitePage: Group answers by question key (Q-number),<br/>sort oldest to newest (proposed)
    alt The site has no answers for the question
        SitePage-->>Steward: Show "no answers for this question"
    else Answers exist
        SitePage-->>Steward: List answers by date (AT 1, AT 2, AT 3)
    end

    Note over Dash,DB: Today getTotalInspectionCount, get_naturalness_distribution and get_top_sites_distribution<br/>have no role check and no date range. The site page groups by question id, newest first.<br/>Legacy SIRs in inspectheader and inspectdetails are not read (schema split).<br/>Open question: "every SIR" in 7.0.4 AT 2 includes deactivated SIRs only if the team decides so.<br/>getFormResponsesBySite reads active SIRs only.
